  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell blesses a corpse with positive energy, preventing it from being turned into an undead creature. Attempts to raise the corpse as an undead automatically fail. If the corpse is of a person slain by a creature that creates undead out of its slain foes (such as a shadow, vampire, or wraith), that effect is delayed until the end of this spell. It is possible to protect a corpse for an extended time by casting this spell each day.\n\nSanctify corpse can be made permanent with a permanency spell by a caster of 9th level or higher for the cost of 500 gp.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell blesses a corpse with positive energy, preventing it from being turned into an undead creature. attempts to raise the corpse as an undead automatically fail. if the corpse is of a person slain by a creature that creates undead out of its slain foes (such as a shadow, vampire, or wraith), that effect is delayed until the end of this spell. it is possible to protect a corpse for an extended time by casting this spell each day.\\n\\nsanctify corpse can be made permanent with a permanency spell by a caster of 9th level or higher for the cost of 500 gp.\"",
